  "abstract": "Third point in the Huber sweep on the simple Fourier LN ScalarRamp baseline: replace MAE with Huber(\u03b4=0.03), keep curvature \u03bb=1e\u22124, Adam lr=9e\u22124, clip=1.0, drop=0.05, p=36, H=128, learn_gamma=False. Completes the \u03b4 sweep to assess robustness of the observed gain.",
